    <briefdescription>
<para>Close a netcdf or domain file opened with <ref refid="interfacefms2__io__mod_1_1open__file" kindref="compound">open_file</ref> or <ref refid="interfacefms2__io__mod_1_1open__virtual__file" kindref="compound">open_virtual_file</ref>. </para>    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><linebreak/>
Example usage: <verbatim>         call close_file(fileobj)
</verbatim></para><para>Closes any given fileobj opened via <ref refid="interfacefms2__io__mod_1_1open__file" kindref="compound">open_file</ref> or <ref refid="interfacefms2__io__mod_1_1open__virtual__file" kindref="compound">open_virtual_file</ref></para><para><simplesect kind="note"><para>For individual documentation on the listed routines, please see the appropriate helper module. For netcdf files with a structured domain: <ref refid="group__fms__netcdf__domain__io__mod" kindref="compound">fms_netcdf_domain_io_mod</ref>. For netcdf files with an unstructured domain: <ref refid="group__fms__netcdf__unstructured__domain__io__mod" kindref="compound">fms_netcdf_unstructured_domain_io_mod</ref>. For generic netcdf: <ref refid="group__netcdf__io__mod" kindref="compound">netcdf_io_mod</ref>. </para></simplesect>
</para>    </detaileddescription>
